      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COMANCHE RICK (1) finished in the minors last time but only a few starts back broke the clock when winning over 401m at Richmond, taking a Grade 5 in an outstanding 22.68. Smart win three back and looks a key chance here. TEMPEST TIGER (7) was a winner two back when racing on speed but drifted back latest and safely held when 7th and beaten 8 lengths at this track (30.52). Can do much better this time. ZIPPING FINNEGAN (8) has a strong record this trip with four wins and two placings from six starts. Hit the frame latest (30.27) when third at The Gardens in a Grade 5. Can feature in the finish.",
